          <tr><th>Additional accessory</th><td>Hand pull-string onion chopper</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="description">
      <h2>Product Description</h2>
      <div class="description">
        <p>Make everyday food preparation more convenient with this 16-in-1 vegetable cutter. It includes 7 interchangeable stainless-steel blades for different slicing, dicing and shredding tasks, along with a bonus hand pull-string chopper for onion, garlic and ginger.</p>
