          <li><strong>Practical preparation:</strong> Cut hard vegetables such as carrots, potatoes and beets into smaller pieces before use.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="description-gallery">
        <img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HlTa9aXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Vegetable cutter accessories">
        <img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hRPTwTljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Vegetable cutter product details">
        <img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OA2QAJUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Vegetable cutter functions">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="video">
      <h2>Product Video</h2>
      <div class="video-box">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/kIbEat1C1Hc"
          title="16-in-1 Vegetable Cutter demonstration"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="origin"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
